<title>TURKEY: Turkey sells 45-50,000 tonnes fuel to Swiss firm.</title>
<headline>Turkey sells 45-50,000 tonnes fuel to Swiss firm.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refiner Tupras said on Thursday it sold 45,000 to 50,000 tonnes of fuel oil through a tender to the Swiss company Onyx Oil.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the tender, issued on February 26, was awarded at a premium of $3.08 per tonne.</p>
<p>The loading will be from Aliaga refinery on March 16-18, it said.</p>
<p>-- Ankara newsroom +90-312-446 2940</p>
</text>
